  "details": "This feature lets players destroy drones using their camera. A new \"BANG!\" button will be added to the camera that can transform the camera view into a scope-like HUD: when players aim and fire, it projects a particle that can hit drones. On a successful hit, the drone explodes like a firework, and the VRC+ user will have a cooldown time before redeploying their drone again.\n\nP.S. This feature request is heavily inspired by the manga \"VRChat Fantasy Expo!\" Chapter 2: \"What if there was an Update like this?! Shoot the Camera Update!\" by DNZKv3 (https://x.com/DNZKv3/status/1866412074211184889/photo/1)",
